  "bodyHash": "9e606258ace364e0",
  "content": "\n\n<pre><span style=\"font-size:18px\">加入我們的 <span style=\"color:#339;font-size:24px\"><strong>Discord</strong></span>，關注更新進度與分享點子！</span></pre>\n<p><span style=\"color:#339;font-size:24px\"><a style=\"color:#339\" href=\"https://discord.gg/4ebsS4R2hN\" rel=\"nofollow\">&gt;Discord 連結</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hostile-delight/settings/f\" alt=\"\" width=\"Infinity\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/896557/description_3ad55eca-d1ef-458b-af86-a93e3dc0d378.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"766\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#808000\"><strong><span style=\"color:#808000\"><span style=\"color:#9c0\">農夫的盛讚<span style=\"color:#008000\"> 擴充模組 </span></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模組是《農夫的盛讚》的<span style=\"color:#9c0;font-size:24px\"><strong>擴充模組</strong></span>，會利用<span style=\"color:#930;font-size:24px\"> <strong>原版與模組怪獸掉落的素材</strong>&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">來烹飪出各種不同的<strong>食物</strong>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#008080\"><strong>守護者壽司</strong></span>? <span style=\"color:#396\"><strong>炸烏龜蛋</strong></span>? <span style=\"color:#330\"><strong>腐爛培根</strong></span>?</span> 在本模組中都能盡情享用。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模組新增了<strong>數十種食物</strong>、物品與效果！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模組<span>仍在<strong>開發中</strong>，敬請持續關注！</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#9cf;font-size:24px\"><strong>獨特功能</strong></span> ：採集合唱蜂蜜</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">使用玻璃瓶右鍵點擊合唱花朵，即可獲得<span style=\"color:#c9f;font-size:24px\"><strong>合唱蜂蜜瓶！</strong></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>註：我是韓國人，英文能力有限 :(</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:8px\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://patreon.com/CrescentStudio117\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://patreon.com/CrescentStudio117</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#36f\"><strong><span>常見問題：</span></strong></span></p>\n<pre><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span><span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:24px\"><strong>問：</strong></span> 是否有計畫將<span style=\"color:#fc9\"><strong>肉類</strong></span>（動物名稱）加入模組？<br><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:24px\"><strong>答：</strong></span></span><span>我<strong>沒有計畫</strong>將<span style=\"color:#0f0\"><strong>現實動物的肉</strong></span>加入模組，因為我認為這不符合模組的概念。</span></span></pre>\n<pre><span style=\"font-size:18px\">（蝙蝠、蜘蛛等除外）村民／災厄村民的肉也是如此。</span></pre>\n<pre><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#36f\"><strong><span><span style=\"font-size:24px\">問</span>：</span></strong></span><span>能否請你為（奇幻生物名稱）增加肉類？<br></span><span><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:24px\"><strong>答：</strong></span>當然可以！</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#9cf\"><strong>歡迎提供建議！</strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span><br><span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:24px\"><strong>問：</strong></span>你有計畫為模組中的<strong>奇幻生物</strong>新增食物嗎（例如<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ff0\">Alex 的生物</span></strong></span>）？<br><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:24px\"><strong>答：</strong></span></span><span>目前不確定，但之後當我為原版生物想完<strong>食物點子</strong>後，可能會考慮將部分模組設為可選依賴項，並<strong>為它們製作食物</strong>。</span></span></pre>\n<pre><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>（目前正在開發與《Alex 的生物》及《冰與火之龍》的相容性。其他模組相容內容敬請期待下次更新！）<br><br></strong></span></span></pre>\n<pre><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><strong><span>若您未經允許在無關場合使用我們模組的貼圖，我們將依法採取行動，恕不另行通知。</span></strong></span></pre>\n<pre><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><br><br></strong></span><br></span></pre>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
